    "name": "Tifawine Festival",
    "id": "tifawine-festival",
    "description": "Rural arts festival held annually in Tafraout and the Ammeln valley (Anti-Atlas), organized by the Association Festival Tifawine to promote Amazigh culture and village life through concerts, cultural events, a friendship football league, agricultural product exhibits and a national Tifinagh competition.",
